WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:03.880
If you want a
life of purpose,

00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:06.590
begin by inverting
the notion

00:00:06.883 --> 00:00:08.968
that everything happens
for a reason.

00:00:12.888 --> 00:00:14.473
All your efforts,

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:16.100
personal,

00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:18.227
professional,

00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:20.855
carnal...

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:26.903
You must be willing to
make the hard choices,

00:00:27.403 --> 00:00:29.197
do the unpleasant things,

00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:32.075
risk your most
valuable assets.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.620
Because nothing
worthwhile

00:00:37.122 --> 00:00:40.958
is ever achieved
without sacrifice.

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:49.717
Now that you’re on
the brink of greatness

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.695
are there
still limitations

00:00:55.697 --> 00:00:57.767
to what you’d be
willing to sacrifice?

00:00:58.142 --> 00:01:01.145
In this case, a night
alone with your husband.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.147
Would that be an
acceptable condition

00:01:03.147 --> 00:01:05.525
of a firm offer to
finance your company?

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:11.530
What do you really know
about Anne Montgomery?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.243
Things could get
dangerous very quickly.

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:18.245
Things have always
been dangerous.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.373
Sean!

00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:24.043
What is it that you
imagine I did to him?

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.212
I made a mistake.

00:01:26.587 --> 00:01:29.132
But I do not deserve
to lose everything.

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:34.178
Regret is all I’ve felt
since the moment we met.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:35.972
How many more people
need to be hurt

00:01:35.972 --> 00:01:37.432
before you get
what you want?

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:39.975
You’re more committed
than you realize.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.147
The worst kind of victim

00:01:45.315 --> 00:01:47.317
is the one that chooses
to create another.

00:01:47.775 --> 00:01:50.237
I am no one’s victim.

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:54.532
Are you
absolutely certain

00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:56.367
this is the choice
you want to make?

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.077
I’m not what
you think I am.

00:01:58.077 --> 00:01:58.953
Maybe not.

00:01:58.953 --> 00:02:00.705
But I’m beginning to
see potential.

00:02:03.958 --> 00:02:07.587
True success
comes at any cost.

